%H A309064 Wikipedia, <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Snub_square_tiling">Snub square tiling</a>.
%H A309064 <a href="/index/Rec#order_1026">Index entries for linear recurrences with constant coefficients</a>, order 1026.
%F A309064 a(n+1025) = a(n) + 25 for n > 96420. - _Lars Blomberg_, Aug 15 2019
%F A309064 Recurrence: a(n) = a(n-1) + a(n-1025) - a(n-1026) for n >= 97447. - _Jianing Song_, Aug 01 2026
